  "body": "With its charming character exterior and gorgeous views, this delightful home captures what makes living in the Bays special. \r\n\r\nWith a short stroll to local beaches, shops and eateries, it's easy to enjoy the best of coastal living.\r\n\r\nFor families, Folkestone Street is perfectly zoned for your children to walk to Rangitoto College, or any of the excellent local primary/intermediate schools and childcare centres. \r\n\r\nTastefully refreshed inside and out, the home offers a versatile two-level layout. Upstairs the master bedroom, with its ensuite and walk in wardrobe, and a separate lounge enjoy expansive views to Rangitoto Island and across the valley. A generous upper deck provides a lovely spot to soak in those views with your favourite beverage.\r\n\r\nDownstairs two further bedrooms, a family bathroom and the main living area open out to a sheltered, private courtyard perfect for the BBQ.\r\n\r\nWith an easy-care garden and good parking, this is a home that is rarely on the market.",
